OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA mostly cloudy day although a
OL,6,Ffew bright spells may break through at
OL,7,Ftimes. Mainly dry but a few light
OL,8,Fshowers possible at first. Light
OL,9,Fwesterly winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FThis evening will be dry.
OL,12,FThen the rest of the night will remain
OL,13,Fdry with variable amounts of cloud and
OL,14,Fsome clear periods. Light winds.
OL,15,
OL,16,CMonday:FIt will be a dry day with
OL,17,Fvariable amounts of cloud and some
OL,18,Fsunny spells.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
