OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FDry
OL,6,Fon Tuesday and Wednesday with bright
OL,7,Fspells. Cloudier and breezier on
OL,8,FThursday with the chance of a little
OL,9,Fshowery rain.
